  <work><work-title>Unrest (Op. 19 No. 8)</work-title></work><movement-title>G. Schirmer (1915), ed. Constantin von Sternberg</movement-title><identification>
    <creator type="composer">F. Mendelssohn</creator><miscellaneous>
      <miscellaneous-field name="source-editorial-footnote">a) The melody lies here in the notes which the thumb of the r.h. has to play; the characteristic figure of the (upper) accompaniment must be subordinated to it.</miscellaneous-field>
